<title>USA: Dow lower at start.</title>
<headline>Dow lower at start.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow industrials took their cue from a weak bond market at the start of trading on Monday and moved lower.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials index was off 11 at 6728. The 30-year long bond off 3/32 to yield 7.15 percent.</p>
